s/comments/2465101229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98881#issuecomment-2465101229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98881","id":2465101229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S7nWt","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T15:54:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T15:58:34Z","body":"I'm closing this PR and related PRs #98905, #98906, and #98908 because [these kind of big changes usually require a proposal first](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals). This is because, there, the community and core Godot maintainers can discuss on the merit of such proposals.\r\n\r\nI'm closing #98880 and #98563 too because, like the previous ones, they are are essentially doing _nothing_. By nothing, I mean that they don't seem to solve real problems. I highly suggest you to read the [Best practices for engine contributors](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/best_practices_for_engine_contributors.html) from our docs, especially [the best practices section](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/best_practices_for_engine_contributors.html#best-practices). Number 2 says: \"To solve the problem, it has to exist in the first place\".\r\n\r\nAre you actively using Doxygen and had issues with the current formatting? Did you get actually get problems with C functions clashing with C++ namespaces? If so, please state it in the description.\r\n\r\nTalking about descriptions: especially if it's not a simple bug fix, it is vital to describe your PRs. This forces reviewers to checkout your code and try to understand what's the intent.\r\n\r\nDon't hesitate to join our [Developer's Chat](https://chat.godotengine.org/) if you have questions or if you need help for your next PRs. We do even have a [\\#new-contributors channel](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/new-contributors)!\r\n\r\nSee you there!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465101229/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]